BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20251031T173000Z
DTEND:20251031T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260722T023309Z
UID:s0501tljhf749qgkm33u4gkqfs@google.com
CREATED:20251028T134410Z
DESCRIPTION:All parents who are planning to attend\, please adhere to the f
 ollowing arrangements. \n\n·        Cones and barriers will be set up to de
 signate the route and enforce that parents should not park in the circle dr
 iveway or staff parking lot.\n\n·        Kindergarten and 1st grade parents
  should view the parade in the parking lot area\, lining up along the route
 . \n\n·        2nd and 3rd grade parents should assemble in front of the sc
 hool.\n\n·        4th and 5th grade parents should assemble on Windermere R
 oad as the students are entering the building.\n\n·        Dismissal will b
 e at our regular time of 2:35pm. We will not be able to accommodate any ear
 ly pickups safely. \n\n*If students do not wish to participate in the parad
 e\, we will have a supervised alternate activity planned.\n\nUnfortunately\
 , if it rains\, the parade will take place indoors at the same time and due
  safety and security concerns parents will not be allowed inside. We will m
 onitor the weather and send out a final update by 11:00AM.
LAST-MODIFIED:20251028T134411Z
LOCATION:Northeast Elementary School\, 603 Grove St\, Montclair\, NJ 07043\
 , USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Northeast Halloween Parade
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
